        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Premise:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cube far down in some structure. You've been there for a long time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/804f4170aaf09591b9fb55d985350ba1.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/804f4170aaf09591b9fb55d985350ba1.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/804f4170aaf09591b9fb55d985350ba1.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious voice talks to you and speaks of a beautiful world above.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your ascent you'll find buttons. It's your choice whether you push them. I recommend you push them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/65b62b82fcf7678ad48193a76c3e2018.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/65b62b82fcf7678ad48193a76c3e2018.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/65b62b82fcf7678ad48193a76c3e2018.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short and simple 2D platformer. I wanted to make each level special with unique platforming, interesting monologue or a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/4003eab2117e3152165a1e1d773a5ec8.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/4003eab2117e3152165a1e1d773a5ec8.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/4003eab2117e3152165a1e1d773a5ec8.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Beautiful World above:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to see the Beautiful World above for yourself. Please do not look online to see how it looks like, the journey is an important part of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/eb5b330638cff1560ef1c516db5a8c23.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/eb5b330638cff1560ef1c516db5a8c23.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/eb5b330638cff1560ef1c516db5a8c23.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Premise:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cube far down in some structure. You've been there for a long time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/804f4170aaf09591b9fb55d985350ba1.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/804f4170aaf09591b9fb55d985350ba1.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/804f4170aaf09591b9fb55d985350ba1.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious voice talks to you and speaks of a beautiful world above.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your ascent you'll find buttons. It's your choice whether you push them. I recommend you push them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/65b62b82fcf7678ad48193a76c3e2018.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/65b62b82fcf7678ad48193a76c3e2018.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/65b62b82fcf7678ad48193a76c3e2018.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short and simple 2D platformer. I wanted to make each level special with unique platforming, interesting monologue or a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/4003eab2117e3152165a1e1d773a5ec8.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/4003eab2117e3152165a1e1d773a5ec8.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/4003eab2117e3152165a1e1d773a5ec8.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Beautiful World above:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to see the Beautiful World above for yourself. Please do not look online to see how it looks like, the journey is an important part of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/eb5b330638cff1560ef1c516db5a8c23.poster.avif?t=1761309243\" width=240 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/eb5b330638cff1560ef1c516db5a8c23.webm?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981780/extras/eb5b330638cff1560ef1c516db5a8c23.mp4?t=1761309243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy!</p>",
